"Kingdee currency number (BD_Currency, e.g. PRE001) sent as the settlement currency "
"(FTRADINGCURRID) of the customer. The default from Settings (Kingdee) is used when "
"empty."
msgstr "作为客户结算币别（FTRADINGCURRID）的金蝶币别编码（BD_Currency，如 PRE001）。留空时取“设置 → Kingdee”的默认值。"

