msgstr "作为客户结算币别的金蝶币别编码，如 PRE001（人民币）。"

#. module: sn_wsd_kingdee
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_kingdee.field_res_partner__kingdee_sales_dept_number
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_kingdee.field_res_users__kingdee_sales_dept_number
msgid ""
"Kingdee department number (BD_Department) sent as FSALDEPTID. This account refuses a "
"customer without it. The default from Settings (Kingdee) is used when empty."
msgstr "发送为 FSALDEPTID 的金蝶部门编号（BD_Department）。本账套不接受缺少该值的客户；留空时取“设置 → Kingdee”的默认值。"

