"Kingdee department number (BD_Department) this account requires on a customer "
"(FSALDEPTID). Each partner can override it."
msgstr "本账套要求的客户销售部门编号（BD_Department，对应 FSALDEPTID）。每个客户可覆盖。"

#. module: sn_wsd_kingdee
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_kingdee.field_sn_wsd_kingdee_bill_map__note_field
msgid ""
"Kingdee field receiving the Odoo document number, which is what lets a double entry "
"month be reconciled line by line. Empty when the object has no free text header field: "
"purchase orders and purchase receipts only carry a line note."
msgstr "接收 Odoo 单号的金蝶字段，双录阶段据此逐单核对。对象没有表头备注字段时留空：采购订单与采购入库只有行备注。"

