"Kingdee material category number (FCategoryID), e.g. CHLB05_SYS (产成品) or CHLB03_SYS "
"(自制半成品). The default from Settings is used when empty."
msgstr "该物料的金蝶物料类别编码（FCategoryID），如 CHLB05_SYS（产成品）、CHLB03_SYS（自制半成品）；留空时取设置中的默认值。"

