"Kingdee material type (FErpClsID): 1 purchased, 2 self-made, 3 subcontract (the options"
" of the account). The default from Settings is used when empty."
msgstr "该物料的金蝶物料属性编码（FErpClsID），如 2=自制、3=委外（账套实测值）；留空时取设置中的默认值。"

